    <string name="setup_home_body">The Home button on the remote should open this screen. Android will ask which launcher to use: pick this one and \"Always\".</string>
    <string name="setup_home_do">Make it the Home app</string>
    <string name="setup_service_title">Home button service</string>
    <string name="setup_disclosure">The launcher uses Android\'s accessibility service. It makes the remote\'s Home button open this screen, shows messages over apps and pauses the video, and locks the TV on the parents\' schedule. The service sees only the name of the app that came to the front and the remote\'s key presses while the TV is locked. It does not read what is on the screen, any text or passwords, and sends nothing to the internet. You can turn it off in the TV\'s accessibility settings.</string>
