    <string name="cloud_title">Phone and cloud</string>
    <string name="cloud_intro">Control this TV from your phone when you are away from home. The TV only connects out to the server; nothing connects in, and no port is opened at home.</string>
    <string name="cloud_learns_title">What the server learns</string>
    <string name="cloud_learns">The name of this TV, the package names and labels of the apps in front and the times the screen was on, the last events of the journal, and the messages you send. It does not learn the parents code, the Wi-Fi name or anything you watch. Data older than 30 days is deleted.</string>
